msgctxt "184"
msgid ""
"Ah, so we meet again... It would seem we're bound by destiny\r\n"
"after all."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "196"
msgid "Who are you again?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "208"
msgid "Name's Shiraishi. I'm in the \"bet collection\" business."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "220"
msgid "Bet collection?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "232"
msgid ""
"I make sure folks pay up on the bets they lose at casinos.\r\n"
"That guy over there, an owner of a bar, lost his fortune at\r\n"
"the poker table the other day."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "244"
msgid ""
"In his final hand, he bet the deed to his bar, and...\r\n"
"Well, he ended up losing it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "256"
msgid "So... I'm here to collect."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "268"
msgid ""
"But you know, it's no fun grabbin' stuff away from a bawlin'\r\n"
"crybaby."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "280"
msgid ""
"That's why I figured I'd go my usual route and let him try\r\n"
"to win back the deed."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "292"
msgid "And what's your usual route?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "304"
msgid ""
"When there's a lot of cash on the line, I challenge the poor\r\n"
"sap to a game of pool to decide whether I should actually\r\n"
"collect or not."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "316"
msgid ""
"They're hangin' on by a thread, see, and I give 'em one last\r\n"
"chance, to see if they got what it takes."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "328"
msgid "That's a pretty crooked hobby, messing with people like that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "340"
msgid ""
"Maybe so... But that crooked hobby has also saved its share\r\n"
"of people, too. I've seen it happen from time to time."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "352"
msgid ""
"Okay, but what does any of this have to do with me? You\r\n"
"just wanted to share some random stories with me, or what?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "364"
msgid ""
"No, that's not it. I was actually hopin' you could be a\r\n"
"stand-in... for the bar owner, that is."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "376"
msgid "Are you kidding me?"
msgstr "Mi stai prendendo per il culo?"

msgctxt "388"
msgid ""
"Please! I'm begging you! I'm the owner of the bar you were\r\n"
"talking to Shiraishi-san about."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "400"
msgid ""
"Please, won't you help me? For the love of all that is good\r\n"
"and noble, I need your assistance! You've got to take my\r\n"
"place at the pool table!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "412"
msgid "And why should I do that?"
msgstr "E perché dovrei?"

msgctxt "424"
msgid ""
"Because I've never played pool in my life⑬not even once!\r\n"
"Can't you see I'm doomed from the very start? He wants a\r\n"
"worthy opponent, and I'm the total opposite!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "436"
msgid ""
"So there you have it. Where's the fun in playin' a game\r\n"
"I know I'm gonna win? That's where you come in."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "448"
msgid "You really are a manipulative old codger, you know that?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "460"
msgid ""
"That may be... But if you do manage to win, you'll be saving\r\n"
"this poor fellow along with his forfeit bar. So whaddya say?\r\n"
"Think of it as a charity match."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "472"
msgid "Please! I'm begging you!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "484"
msgid "Sorry, but I don't think I can help you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "496"
msgid "I see... Well that's too bad."
msgstr "Capisco... Che peccato."

msgctxt "508"
msgid ""
"But I gotta tell ya, I'm just about the most persistent\r\n"
"old bastard you've ever met at the gamblin' table. So I'll\r\n"
"be waitin' right here until you change your mind."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "520"
msgid "Hey, it's your time to waste."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "532"
msgid "Well... Don't make me wait too long, now..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "556"
msgid "Fine then. You're on."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "568"
msgid ""
"Excellent. I could tell just by the look of you that you\r\n"
"were a true warrior."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "580"
msgid ""
"The game is nine-ball pool. Whoever sinks the nine ball\r\n"
"first wins."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "592"
msgid "All right."
msgstr "Va bene."

msgctxt "604"
msgid ""
"You've got to win this one! I swear there's a reward in it\r\n"
"for you if you do!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "616"
msgid "Now... let's begin. Don't let me down."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "640"
msgid ""
"Young man... Have you decided to try and win back the deed\r\n"
"to that bar?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "652"
msgid "Sorry, but... This has nothing to do with me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "664"
msgid "I see... Well that's too bad."
msgstr "Capisco... Che peccato."

